    "bal_qb_and_offense_alert": "With Lamar Jackson (excluded IR / thumb surgery) and Tyler Huntley (excluded out for season / turf toe) both inactive, Joe Fagnano is Baltimore's active Week 9 QB1 ($8,400 SD FLEX; Jacoby Brissett emergency QB2). SiriusXM Elite Sports (Jeff Mans) documented how Baltimore's offense was whitewashed 35-13 by Cincinnati without its franchise QB: perimeter WRs lost vertical separation ceiling, active TEs Mark Andrews and Josh Cuevas absorbed short checkdowns, and Derrick Henry faced stacked boxes without the QB read-option freeze.",
    "jax_usage_and_ship_it_nation_notes": "JAX won 42-7 in Week 8 (89th-percentile offensive EPA) and is the only NFL team top-5 in both offensive and defensive EPA/play. Ship It Nation (Tambo & Alex Blickle) highlighted Bhayshul Tuten ($9,800 SD FLEX, 17.3 FPPG, Q) and Brenton Strange ($7,400 SD FLEX, 9.6 FPPG) as high-leverage volume plays while Brian Thomas Jr. ($6,400 SD FLEX, 4.8 FPPG) remains on slump/trade-rumor watch."
  },
